===Etymology===
* According to {{w|Erich Berneker}} and {{w|Max Vasmer}}, from {{affix|ru|ма́терь|-и́к}}.
* Accentologically, according to {{w|Andrey Zaliznyak}}, from {{affix|ru|матеро́й|-и́к}} with a right-stressed substitutive subjective suffix (see: {{m|ru|матёрый}}). As well as {{m|ru|временно́й}} > {{m|ru|временни́к}}, {{m|ru|мелочно́й}} > {{m|ru|мелочни́к}}, but {{m|ru|варёный}} > {{m|ru|варе́ник}}.

